Terminals unused in grammar

   REPEAT
   UNTIL
   FUNCTION
   RETURN
   COMMA


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: statement

    2 statement: declaration_stmt
    3          | assignment_stmt
    4          | expression SEMICOLON
    5          | if_stmt
    6          | while_stmt
    7          | for_stmt
    8          | switch_stmt

    9 declaration_stmt: type IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   10                 | CONST type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
   11                 | type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

   12 type: INT
   13     | FLOAT_TYPE
   14     | STRING_TYPE
   15     | CHAR_TYPE

   16 assignment_stmt: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

   17 assign: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   18 expression: expression PLUS T
   19           | expression MINUS T
   20           | T

   21 T: T MULTIPLY F
   22  | T DIVIDE F
   23  | T MODULO F
   24  | F

   25 F: LPAREN expression RPAREN
   26  | MINUS F
   27  | IDENTIFIER
   28  | FLOAT
   29  | NUMBER

   30 condition: expression EQUAL expression
   31          | expression NOT_EQUAL expression
   32          | expression LESS_THAN expression
   33          | expression GREATER_THAN expression
   34          | expression LESS_EQUAL expression
   35          | expression GREATER_EQUAL expression
   36          | expression AND expression
   37          | expression OR expression
   38          | NOT expression

   39 $@1: /* empty */

   40 if_stmt: IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement RBRACE $@1 IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement RBRACE ELSE LBRACE statement RBRACE

   41 while_stmt: WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement RBRACE

   42 for_stmt: FOR LPAREN declaration_stmt condition SEMICOLON assign RPAREN LBRACE statement RBRACE

   43 switch_stmt: SWITCH LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE case_list RBRACE
   44            | SWITCH LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE case_list default_case RBRACE

   45 case_list: case_stmt
   46          | case_list case_stmt

   47 case_stmt: CASE expression COLON statement
   48          | CASE expression COLON statement BREAK SEMICOLON

   49 default_case: DEFAULT COLON statement
   50             | DEFAULT COLON statement BREAK SEMICOLON


